 that never seems to get installed.<BR>29. Two years ago, your mom used to drive you to school in what's now your 'race car'.<BR>30. Your bright green $300 air filter is bigger than your engine.<BR> <BR><p>[This message has been edited by Jake_Dragon (edited 11-30-2001).]||||reg||1
